EditPad 46.1 (2026.02.19)
-First public release.


EditPad 46.2 (2026.03.02)
-Added ARexx port and comands: QUIT, OPEN, SAVE and SAVEAS.
-Added PORTNAME and PORTUNIQUE=UNIQUE arguments/tooltypes.
-Added in about window ARexx port name.
-Changed to use TheBar.mcc instead of "simple" buttons.
-Refactored/cleaned code.
-Added menu options: MARK ALL, TOUPPER case and TOLOWER case.
-Show error when loading/saving file fails.
-Added saving recent list to 'ENVARC:EditPad_recent' file.
-Added menu option: CLEAR RECENTS.

EditPad 46.3 (2026.04.12)
-Removed debug output.
-Added context popup menu.
-Fixed typos, code cleaning.
